---
title: Sequence Diagram — Log in
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant R as routes/auth
    participant MW as authLimiter + validateLogin
    participant C as controllers/auth
    participant UM as User model
    participant RT as RefreshToken model
    participant DB as MongoDB

    U->>R: POST /api/v1/auth/login {email, password}
    R->>MW: check rate limit (per IP) and input
    alt too many attempts
        MW-->>U: 429 Too Many Requests
    else email or password missing / not a string
        MW-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    end
    MW->>C: login(req, res)
    C->>UM: findOne({email}).select(+password)
    UM->>DB: query users
    DB-->>UM: user document
    C->>UM: matchPassword(password)  (bcrypt.compare)
    alt user not found or wrong password
        C-->>U: 401 Invalid credentials
    else valid
        C->>UM: getSignedJwtToken()  (15-min access token)
        C->>RT: create({user, tokenHash: sha256(refresh)})
        RT->>DB: insert refreshtokens
        C-->>U: 200 {token, role} + Set-Cookie token, refreshToken (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict)
    end
